;; Babashka classpath for the reconstruction lanes.
;;
;; bb hosts the pure-data lanes: handoff validation, rubric grading, judge
;; parsing, and the event ledger. The DSP lane (librosa/matplotlib via
;; libpython-clj) cannot run here — bb's native image has no JNA — so it lives
;; behind the JVM :metrics alias in deps.edn. The two runtimes never call each
;; other; they both append to ledgers/reconstruction.edn.
{:paths ["src" "scripts" "resources"]}
